  "en": {
    "A rider swooped low over the walls, its wings tearing the smoke into ribbons.": "en/a85a63845ab4.mp3",
    "A runner closes the last rift and the worlds heal.": "en/9408e00182ac.mp3",
    "Cracks spread across the floor, but the old stones refused to give way.": "en/3139e55ada91.mp3",
    "Did the floor break apart?": "en/5919f605a975.mp3",
    "Each word you read sends power into the seal, brighter and stronger than before.": "en/a0370214f8a5.mp3",
    "Every world you crossed was stitched to this place by a thread of rift fire.": "en/32c601ff11a6.mp3",
    "First came the swarms, then the armored brutes, and last of all the shadow riders.": "en/d70ea76adee2.mp3",
    "How did the first trail feel?": "en/60c3400f5e07.mp3",
    "How has the runner changed since the first trail?": "en/024c9f410aaa.mp3",
    "If the core stays open, the broken worlds will keep falling apart.": "en/752f64cf82a4.mp3",
    "It turned to ice.": "en/f76f51eb8b2f.mp3",
    "Long ago, the worlds were whole. Then the rifts tore them apart, and creatures poured through the cracks. Runners crossed the forest, the dunes, the ice and the sea. They carried the light from world to world. Now the last runner stands at the core. With every word, the broken pieces return to their places. The light grows stronger. The rift is sealed.": "en/2d3905863f96.mp3",
    "No, the stones held.": "en/e5ea05fac9eb.mp3",
    "Nothing will change.": "en/9fc4b1615de1.mp3",
    "Now you move like a true Rift Runner, quick and certain, and the core is finally within reach.": "en/37af158b417f.mp3",
    "Purple light poured out of the crack, and the air hummed like a storm about to break.": "en/df76f22f8c01.mp3",
